## MarketRegular Recommended week plan

- **Need something Monday:** Start at [Sorauren](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/sorauren-farmers-market) (or [Henderson indoor](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/sorauren-farmers-market-henderson-brewery) in winter).
- **Midweek organic / year-round:** [Dufferin Grove](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/dufferin-grove-organic-farmers-market) Thursday 3–7.
- **High-traffic named stops:** [Underpass Park](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/underpass-park-farmers-market) (Thu), [Withrow](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/withrow-park-farmers-market) (Sat), [Brick Works](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/evergreen-brick-works-saturday-farmers-market) (Sat), [Malvern](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/malvern-urban-farm-farmers-market) (Wed), [Allan Gardens](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/allan-gardens-farmers-market) (Sat).
- **Biggest Saturday:** North St. Lawrence from 5 AM, then Brick Works / Withrow / Junction / The Stop depending on your side of town.
- **Sunday split:** Eglinton Way early (Burnaby), Leslieville midday (Greenwood), Afro-Caribbean later (Fairbank) — not the same strip.

**MarketRegular Tip:** “Open today” searches and day-of-week searches are how most people actually shop markets — not giant “best of” lists. Use [open today](https://www.marketregular.com/markets/open-today) when you’re leaving the house, and this guide when you’re planning the week. Winter doesn’t kill the calendar: Brick Works and The Stop flip indoor, Allan Gardens and Dufferin Grove keep going, North St. Lawrence stays Saturday-only year-round, and Sorauren moves to Henderson.

